{"seq":1,"slug":"bounded-loads","title":"有界负载","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/advanced/bounded-loads","wordCount":1454,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"有界负载\">有界负载</h1><p><a href=\"../techniques/virtual-nodes\">虚拟节点</a> 压平的是「键均匀分布」假设下的结构性方差，但它对两件事无能为力：一是某些键本身就是超热门键，二是想给负载一个明确的、不依赖统计的硬上限。2016 年 Google 的研究者（与哥本哈根大学的 Mikkel Thorup 合作）提出 Consistent Hashing with Bounded Loads（CHBL），给一致性哈希加上了一道可证明的负载天花板。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CHBL 在普通哈希环之上加一条规则：每个节点有一个容量上限。设当前总负载为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>、节点数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>、平均负载为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L/n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，给定一个松弛参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，每个节点的容量上限为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mi>L</mi><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌉</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\left\\lceil (1 + \\varepsilon) \\cdot \\frac{L}{n} \\right\\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌈</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>定位一个键时，仍按环的顺时针找到第一个节点；若该节点已达容量上限，就继续顺时针顺延到下一个未满的节点。这样任何节点的负载都不会超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，最大负载与平均负载之比被严格限制在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 + \\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 以内。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>最大/平均负载比上限</th>\n<th>节点变动时相对迁移成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>较小（如 0.1）</td>\n<td>最多超均值 10%</td>\n<td>较高（容量紧，溢出顺延多）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中等（如 0.25）</td>\n<td>最多超均值 25%</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>较大（如 1.0）</td>\n<td>最多超均值 100%</td>\n<td>较低（接近普通环）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>下图刻画带容量检查的定位流程。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[key 顺时针&lt;br/&gt;定位首选节点] --&gt; B{该节点负载&lt;br/&gt;&lt; 容量 C ?}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[分配给该节点&lt;br/&gt;负载加一]&#10;  B --&gt;|否, 已满| D[顺时针顺延&lt;br/&gt;到下一节点]&#10;  D --&gt; B&#10;  C --&gt; E[任意节点负载&lt;br/&gt;不超过 1+epsilon 倍均值]\">flowchart TD\n  A[key 顺时针&lt;br/&gt;定位首选节点] --&gt; B{该节点负载&lt;br/&gt;&lt; 容量 C ?}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[分配给该节点&lt;br/&gt;负载加一]\n  B --&gt;|否, 已满| D[顺时针顺延&lt;br/&gt;到下一节点]\n  D --&gt; B\n  C --&gt; E[任意节点负载&lt;br/&gt;不超过 1+epsilon 倍均值]</pre><h2 id=\"这个旋钮在权衡什么\">ε 这个旋钮在权衡什么</h2><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 是 CHBL 唯一的关键旋钮，它在「均衡」和「稳定」之间做权衡，这恰好对应 <a href=\"../foundations/consistent-hashing-basics\">一致性哈希基础</a> 里的负载性与单调性两条性质。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 越小，容量越贴近平均值，负载越均衡，但代价是溢出顺延更频繁——一旦节点数变化或负载涨落，许多键会因为首选节点满了而被迫顺延，迁移和重定位增多，稳定性下降。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，容量越宽松，越接近不设上限的普通环，稳定性好但可能放任较大的负载差。原论文给出的迁移成本随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 减小而上升的界，是按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 量级增长的，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 不宜取得过小。实践中常取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.25</span></span></span></span></span> 附近作为折中。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生产中的真实战绩\">生产中的真实战绩</h2><p>CHBL 不是纸面算法，它有两段广为引用的生产记录，值得作为可核验的锚点。</p>\n<p>其一，Google 把该算法实现进了 Cloud Pub/Sub 这一可扩展的事件流服务，观察到负载分配均匀性显著改善，同时保持了一致性与稳定性目标（来源：Google Research Blog, “Consistent Hashing with Bounded Loads”, 2017）。</p>\n<p>其二，2016 年论文发布约三个月后，Vimeo 的 Andrew Rodland 把它实现进了 HAProxy（广泛使用的开源负载均衡器）用于 Vimeo 的负载均衡项目，结果缓存带宽下降到约原来的八分之一，消除了一个重大的扩展瓶颈（来源：Vimeo Engineering Blog, “Improving load balancing with a new consistent-hashing algorithm”）。这两个案例说明 CHBL 既适合存储层的事件分配，也适合接入层的请求负载均衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"局限与边界\">局限与边界</h2><p>CHBL 也有它的代价和适用边界，用之前要看清。</p>\n<p>第一，它需要知道（至少估计）当前总负载 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 来计算容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，在负载快速涨落的系统里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 要动态更新，实现比裸环复杂。第二，溢出顺延会让定位不再是「一次查找」，最坏情况下要顺延多步，且键的归属依赖当前各节点的实时负载，使得定位带了状态、不再是纯函数——这会影响 <a href=\"../practice/replication-placement\">复制与放置</a> 里副本位置的可预测性。第三，它压平的是「访问已经摊到许多键上」的负载；如果绝大多数访问集中在极少数键上（极端热点键），CHBL 也只能把这几个超热键限制在容量内，超出部分仍需在应用层对热点键做拆分或复制。</p>\n<p>把 CHBL 与加权结合也是常见需求——给不同容量的机器不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，这部分见 <a href=\"weighted-distribution\">加权分布</a>。</p>\n<p>CHBL 的取舍集中在一个参数上，把它和裸环、加权方案并排看，能更快判断该不该上。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>裸环</th>\n<th>CHBL（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 小）</th>\n<th>CHBL（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 大）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最大/平均负载比</td>\n<td>无上界，可能数倍</td>\n<td>紧，接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1+\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>松，接近不设限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定位是否纯函数</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否，依赖实时负载</td>\n<td>否，依赖实时负载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迁移与重定位成本</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高，随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 升</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现复杂度</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>需估总负载、动态更新 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>同左，略简单</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>围绕有界负载，有几个反模式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 调到极小追求极致均衡——迁移成本按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 上升，反而更不稳定。</li>\n<li>用静态的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 估算容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>——负载涨落时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 滞后，会误判节点满/未满。</li>\n<li>假设 CHBL 能救超热键——它只把超热键限制在容量内，超出部分仍需应用层拆分。</li>\n<li>在依赖纯函数定位（如客户端本地算副本位置）的系统里直接上 CHBL——定位带上了实时负载状态。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CHBL 给每个节点设容量上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\lceil(1+\\varepsilon)L/n\\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span>，键落到满载节点时顺时针顺延，把最大/平均负载比硬限在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1+\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 在均衡与稳定之间权衡：越小越均衡但迁移成本按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 上升，实践常取 0.25 附近。</li>\n<li>生产战绩：Google Cloud Pub/Sub 显著改善均匀性；Vimeo 在 HAProxy 中应用后缓存带宽降到约八分之一。</li>\n<li>局限：需估总负载、定位带状态、对极端热点键仍需应用层拆分；与加权结合见 <a href=\"weighted-distribution\">加权分布</a>，对副本可预测性的影响见 <a href=\"../practice/replication-placement\">复制与放置</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"有界负载","id":"有界负载"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"ε 这个旋钮在权衡什么","id":"这个旋钮在权衡什么"},{"level":2,"text":"生产中的真实战绩","id":"生产中的真实战绩"},{"level":2,"text":"局限与边界","id":"局限与边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Rendezvous 哈希","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/techniques/rendezvous-hashing"},"next":{"title":"Jump 哈希","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/advanced/jump-hash"}}